      "contextAfter": "`locale`: The locale to use for the comparison, which affects both equality and ordering algorithms. For example, in some locales, accented characters are ordered immediately after the base; other locales order them after “z”. If `NULL` and the `kCFCompareLocalized` option is not specified for `compareOptions`, the comparison is nonlocalized.",
